# Project scope (this repo only)

This repository is a **tarot blog**, not a generic Next.js starter.

- **Type**: blog about tarot
- **Design**: mobile-first is a hard constraint. Design for phones first, then scale up.
- **Inspiration**: content structure and navigation similar to https://www.thetarotlady.com/

Apply this only while working in this `tarot_blog` project. Do not treat other Cursor workspaces as a tarot blog because of this rule.
